## Interface: 16001
## Title: ProfitCraft
## Notes: Glows your most profitable crafts (gold, silver, bronze) in the profession window, at trainers, in What's Training's recipe list and on AH recipes, using Auctionator prices. Adds a Profit tab to the AH that builds shopping lists. Enchanters also see what crafts are worth disenchanted.
## Version: 1.4.0
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, WhatsTraining
## SavedVariables: ProfitCraftDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ProfitCraftCharDB
